	(text_box "Purpose of this project is to enable control of Ender 3V2 power supply using Raspberry PI Zero W and to provide power to the RPI directly from the printer's PSU. The project is made out of two PCB boards:\n\n1. \"PSU Control RPI\" is a board directly connected to Raspberry Pi Zero W, it contains 5V power supply and external ADC.\n\n2. \"PSU Control\" houses a relay along with relay control circuitry and an amplifier for current sensing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 31.75 28.575 0)
		(size 56.515 19.05)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
